The '''Pando Spur''' was a [[hyperspace route]] located entirely within [[Hutt Space]]. It ran from the [[Near Pando system]] in square S-14 of the [[Standard Galactic Grid]] through the [[Far Pando system]] and [[Xolu system]] in square S-13 and then terminated at the [[Hollastin system]] in grid square S-12, which acted as a junction onto the [[Hollastin Run]] route.<ref name="YouTube" />

==Behind the scenes==
In the current ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]], the Pando Spur was shown on a map in "Meet the Hutts: The Galaxy's Biggest Crime Lords," a video in the ''[[Star Wars: Galaxy Guide]]'' series published on the official ''Star Wars'' [[Wikipedia:YouTube|YouTube]] channel on [[September 16]], [[2026]]. The video reused<ref name="YouTube" /> a map created by the artist [[Modi]] that originated in the reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]'', which was written by [[Daniel Wallace]] and Fry. and marked the [[Pando Spur|Pando Spur's]] first mention in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

